{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archaic: UNAUTHORIZED is a story-driven 3D action platformer that blends metroidvania exploration with fluid traversal and tactical melee combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a 17-year-old girl from 2025, suddenly summoned into a future where no organic humans remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a broken civilization governed by digital memory and false immortality, and reignite the forgotten oath of return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse mysterious ruins and massive sky structures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new abilities through a central hub in orbit: Agitory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight rogue androids, corrupted systems, and remnants of humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a world full of secrets, memories, and danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4-hour demo will be available during Next Fest. Try it and see how far her will can go.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay Information (Structured \u2013 English for Steam Page with Video Attachments)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines <strong>three core genres</strong> into a hybrid gameplay experience:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. 3D Platforming X Metroidvania</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows classic 3D platforming rules \u2014 you\u2019ll run, jump, wall-kick, slide, and perform light parkour.<br>You\u2019ll interact with various environmental objects like springs, traps, and safety nets to traverse levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, certain paths are initially unreachable.<br>This is where the <strong>metroidvania-style progression</strong> comes in: unlocking special abilities allows you to access previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>9 unique abilities</strong>, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. TPS Shooting Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes <strong>TPS (Third-Person Shooter)</strong> elements.<br>Players can <strong>aim precisely while moving quickly</strong>, allowing for fluid, responsive gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect and combine <strong>Gun Modules</strong>, enabling you to construct different types of firearms.<br>These can fire specialized rounds with unique properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, <strong>guns alone won\u2019t kill most enemies</strong> \u2014 they can knock them back or stun them at best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Momentum-Based Sword Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords are the most powerful weapons in this world.<br>Unlike guns, swords are <strong>the only way to defeat most enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat revolves around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct 1v1 confrontations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parrying and dodging<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, using momentum and aerial control to land <strong>decisive finishing blows</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering movement and momentum is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Core Identity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game\u2019s <strong>core identity</strong> is the seamless blend of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability-driven metroidvania progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-based combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming traversal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game includes a variety of collectible elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various hairstyles and helmets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfits with functional bonuses depending on what you wear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun modules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of swords with different characteristics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709850?t=1763872930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709850?t=1763872930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/3fd218190d666dbd8c87658f1aea94302a6cd79a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763872930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/3fd218190d666dbd8c87658f1aea94302a6cd79a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763872930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Archaic: UNAUTHORIZED is a story-driven 3D action platformer that blends metroidvania exploration with fluid traversal and tactical melee combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a 17-year-old girl from 2025, suddenly summoned into a future where no organic humans remain.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a broken civilization governed by digital memory and false immortality, and reignite the forgotten oath of return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse mysterious ruins and massive sky structures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new abilities through a central hub in orbit: Agitory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fight rogue androids, corrupted systems, and remnants of humanity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore a world full of secrets, memories, and danger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4-hour demo will be available during Next Fest. Try it and see how far her will can go.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay Information (Structured \u2013 English for Steam Page with Video Attachments)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines <strong>three core genres</strong> into a hybrid gameplay experience:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. 3D Platforming X Metroidvania</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows classic 3D platforming rules \u2014 you\u2019ll run, jump, wall-kick, slide, and perform light parkour.<br>You\u2019ll interact with various environmental objects like springs, traps, and safety nets to traverse levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5f62eb803b983efe9097d5608e3f70c.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, certain paths are initially unreachable.<br>This is where the <strong>metroidvania-style progression</strong> comes in: unlocking special abilities allows you to access previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>9 unique abilities</strong>, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. TPS Shooting Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes <strong>TPS (Third-Person Shooter)</strong> elements.<br>Players can <strong>aim precisely while moving quickly</strong>, allowing for fluid, responsive gunplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect and combine <strong>Gun Modules</strong>, enabling you to construct different types of firearms.<br>These can fire specialized rounds with unique properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, <strong>guns alone won\u2019t kill most enemies</strong> \u2014 they can knock them back or stun them at best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/e5ffad8dbcc964eb46aced767b3e10a6.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Momentum-Based Sword Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords are the most powerful weapons in this world.<br>Unlike guns, swords are <strong>the only way to defeat most enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat revolves around:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct 1v1 confrontations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parrying and dodging<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/d888e0621c6e82e7c630322d3b72a4fa.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, using momentum and aerial control to land <strong>decisive finishing blows</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering movement and momentum is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/645d0a5886c0d47b462e9ed514216897.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Core Identity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game\u2019s <strong>core identity</strong> is the seamless blend of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ability-driven metroidvania progression</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momentum-based combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming traversal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game includes a variety of collectible elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various hairstyles and helmets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outfits with functional bonuses depending on what you wear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun modules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of swords with different characteristics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.poster.avif?t=1763872930\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.webm?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/extras/6f5e5cabaeae06d1af2feb5c8b2c4707.mp4?t=1763872930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["sixsevenths"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709850/88a3b6cbb73c799e78c1e08899d86784fa5df0e6/header.jpg?t=1763872930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamsta